Vinda Store Sales Data Analysis (2022)

An interactive Excel dashboard project analyzing the annual sales, customer demographics, and order performance for Vinda Store for the year 2022.

📊 Project Overview
This project processes and visualizes retail store data to uncover key business insights, sales trends, and channel performance. The goal of this dashboard is to help stakeholders track performance metrics clearly through dynamic charts and pivot tables.

## 🚀 Key Features & Insights
Monthly Sales & Orders Trend: Analyzed month-wise revenue generation and order counts across 2022.
Men vs. Women Sales Breakdown: Evaluated the proportion of sales contribution between male and female customers.
Order Status Distribution: Tracked delivery success rates, including delivered, cancelled, returned, and refunded orders.
Top 5 States: Highlighted the top-performing states based on total sales amount (e.g., Maharashtra, Karnataka, Uttar Pradesh, etc.).
Age & Gender Demographics: Analyzed buying patterns across different age groups (Adult, Senior, Teenager) segmented by gender.
Sales Channels: Compared revenue and order distribution across multiple platforms (Amazon, Myntra, Flipkart, Ajio, Meesho, Nalli, etc.).

🛠️ Tools & Techniques Used
- Microsoft Excel:
- Pivot Tables & Pivot Charts for data aggregation.
- Data Cleaning and Formatting.
- Dashboard UI Design with slicers and interactive components.

 📁 Repository Files
- Vinda Store Analysis 2022.xlsx: The complete Excel workbook containing raw data, pivot calculations, and the final interactive dashboard.
- Vinda Store Data: Cleaned dataset source files.

